      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Santa Claus:"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "你好！我的名字叫小美，我今年六岁了。我是一个好孩子，每天我都好好吃饭，好好睡觉。",
      "traditional": "你好！我的名字叫小美，我今年六歲了。我是一個好孩子，每天我都好好吃飯，好好睡覺。",
      "pinyin": "nǐ hǎo wǒ de míng zi jiào xiǎo měi wǒ jīn nián liù suì le wǒ shì yí ge hǎo hái zi měi tiān wǒ dōu hǎo hǎo chī fàn hǎo hǎo shuì jiào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "妈妈说你会送我一个圣诞礼物。我想要一只小狗。你能送我一只小狗吗？我很喜欢小狗。",
      "traditional": "媽媽說你會送我一個聖誕禮物。我想要一隻小狗。你能送我一隻小狗嗎？我很喜歡小狗。",
      "pinyin": "mā ma shuō nǐ huì sòng wǒ yí ge shèng dàn lǐ wù wǒ xiǎng yào yì zhī xiǎo gǒu nǐ néng sòng wǒ yì zhī xiǎo gǒu ma wǒ hěn xǐ huan xiǎo gǒu",
      "english": "Hello! My name is Little Mei. This year I am 6 years old. I am a good child. Every day, I eat well and sleep well."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "如果你能送我一只小狗，我会很高兴。",
      "traditional": "如果你能送我一隻小狗，我會很高興。",
      "pinyin": "rú guǒ nǐ néng sòng wǒ yì zhī xiǎo gǒu wǒ huì hěn gāo xìng",
      "english": "Mom said you will give me a Christmas present. I want a puppy. Can you give me a puppy? I really like puppies."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "If you can give me a puppy, I would be very happy."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "现在外面很冷，请多穿一些衣服。我会在家里等你。",
      "traditional": "現在外面很冷，請多穿一些衣服。我會在家裡等你。",
      "pinyin": "xiàn zài wài miàn hěn lěng qǐng duō chuān yì xiē yī fu wǒ huì zài jiā lǐ děng nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "It’s very cold outside now. Please wear more clothes. I will wait for you at home."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "谢谢你！圣诞节快乐！",
      "traditional": "謝謝你！聖誕節快樂！",
      "pinyin": "xiè xie nǐ shèng dàn jié kuài lè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Thank you! Merry Christmas!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小美",
      "traditional": "小美",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo měi",
      "english": ""
    }
